  "description": "Post-quantum hybrid JWT library for .NET 10. Signs tokens with ML-DSA-65 (FIPS 204) and optionally encrypts them with X-Wing (X25519 + ML-KEM-768) hybrid key agreement plus AES-256-GCM. Built on the native .NET BCL post-quantum primitives, fail-closed by design, and honest about its security posture. Preview release — not for production use.",
